// TypeError 6941: (336-343): Invalid type for the digest argument of mldsa87verify. The implicit conversion from literal_string "B" to bytes64 would pad the digest with 63 zero bytes on the right, so a signature would have to cover the padded value. Pass a 64-byte value, such as the result of shake256(...), or convert explicitly with bytes64(...) if the padding is intended.
